<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-24T07:29:10.368Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:29:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified missile attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking Riyadh, Khamis Mushait, Dammam airport and an air base, while the Saudi-led coalition has repeatedly intercepted missiles and drones over Saudi territory. In Yemen, water supplies are dwindling in a city under Houthi siege and the UN warns that time is running out to reach Taiz as the crisis deepens. Oil prices have risen to a five-month high on fears of renewed US strikes on Iran and on Houthi attacks that disrupted crude markets. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOeWJ2bGllV1N5MGZKTC1hWXRQUmV5U0xTNll5Q1hTVG1sczNVNjZwNDVuX2NmS2swOFJfOUx0bkpVSGJKWENCZ3AwS2czZ2pXZ3lUOVZXelBMaXZRaUZkX1loWjRndjQ3dXcydFRLdVc3cFQ3ZkRVS2szTTc5S0xtU01CT1hQS0lFX1IxbUNNQk81dzFCbk5wTzhwcHptX0RPejd3eENNdGRLZEM5QmtMMmlUWU9nZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQaVZrWVBoNGh2Mm03d1RPRzdqRHluRW5ZMXhwYTBoMm9tQmQxdXpnek9UZi0ycDVRTnNacUlFMGE3aUdoazRya3lsMUswVi1xUk5sVzNqNmdPb1NvLWdUUFQ3ejJPazJJRl85RTlxNlAwWGtHVEtEUS1GdlUyX3Y4VElqVm4tT0Q4N1RwZE1mU1BUVjlTakNmSkZuRWZYQ1pLR2ZXWVlSUXloTEFnUkdpaEw0SkVDMmFrWElQUmRjaGluOWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/23/oil-five-month-high-fears-us-renews-strikes-iran&quot;&gt;theguardian.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOclpNS0ItS1I1d0NhRlU0cVlSTUVFSEVlakw2SGVuSmtNdl9kWkhSbGFpbFY1NGtIY3RPdkFKLU0xNE1wdHNaNHExWVpyNHh4X3RrNk1Db0gwSDkyOGF2UXBNOU02MlJRbnBMb2hYc1h0eEpqSjZ1N2xJNFJzbWlENkg1THpzLVhBTEJxdVU0NGxfVDBuVEtNO